cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "Aeolus — Risk-Informed Dynamic Rerouting: Computational Study"
abstract: >-
  Companion code and results for the Aeolus computational study: a reproducible
  Monte Carlo simulation of risk-informed dynamic rerouting on a 30-city
  freight network calibrated to Indian line-haul conditions. Reproduces every
  number in the paper's computational study from a fixed seed.
